1️⃣5️⃣ IPv4 Address Classes

Traditional classful addressing:

Class	First Octet	Default Mask

A	1–126	/8
B	128–191	/16
C	192–223	/24
D	224–239	Multicast
E	240–255	Experimental


📌 Modern networks primarily use CIDR, not classful addressing.


