\]

Subnets:

0–63
64–127
128–191
192–255

77 lies in:

64–127

Therefore:

Network

\[
\boxed{192.168.10.64}
\]

Broadcast

\[
\boxed{192.168.10.127}
\]

Usable

192.168.10.65
       ↓
192.168.10.126

Number of usable hosts:

\[
64-2
\]

\[
\boxed{62}
\]


