Suppose your laptop has:

IP:
192.168.1.10

and wants to communicate with:

8.8.8.8

Since the destination is outside the local network, the packet is sent to the:

Default Gateway

Usually the local router.

Laptop
192.168.1.10
     ↓
Router
192.168.1.1
     ↓
Internet


